  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Commandante** (1 other source): The band played this song despite the technical issues that affected the set [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Short Song About the 10 Freeway**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **I Will Survive**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Lion's Teeth [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2004-10-08** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 63 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Technical difficulties plagued the set, though the band still performed Commandante [1]\n- The encore, which included Shadow Song and Orange by Furniture Huschle, is missing [1]",
